  "verificationScope": "# Original global Koszul section matrices and integer coordinate frames\n\nLet K be a field,S the ORIGINAL nonnegative graded K-algebra,H:Fin r->S\nORIGINAL homogeneous forms of degree q,a ORIGINAL degree-one coordinate,\nU ANY original subopen of D_+(a),k ANY integer. Write R=O_X(U),X=Proj S.\nD_p is the SAME ORIGINAL exterior Koszul differential in its canonical\nexterior bases. Its numerator entries have degree q by the earlier proof.\n\nCONSTRUCT ell/a^q as SAME ACTUAL original structure-ring section. PROVE\nhomogeneous multiplication in ORIGINAL integer frames is multiplication\nby ell/a^q. CONSTRUCT actual original integer-twist coordinate maps,prove\northogonality,total identity,bicone and BOTH universal properties. Their\nbiproduct maps are the SAME original coordinate inclusions/projections.\n\nCONSTRUCT whole actual section frame Phi_(p,k,U):R^C(r,p)->K(H)(k)_p(U)\nfrom SAME original coordinates and line frames. PROVE reconstruction,\ncoordinate extraction and compatibility with EVERY original open restriction.\nPROVE the WHOLE SAME ORIGINAL global section map,ALL p and integer k:\n d_p(Phi_(p+1,k,U)(v))\n = Phi_(p,k,U)(j |-> sum_i (D_p[j,i]/a^q)*v_i).\nThis extends the earlier entry formula to the entire original map;neither\nmatrix equality nor desired frames/transition compatibility is assumed.\n\nNo source exactness/regularity or target CM/free/flat/FG/FP/invertibility\nhypothesis is added. Generic arbitrary weights and empty index types\nare retained;Koszul constructions also cover r=0,q=0,k negative.\n\nLet S be the ORIGINAL nonnegative graded K-algebra,H:Fin r->S ORIGINAL degree-q forms,a ORIGINAL degree-one chart coordinate,U ANY original subopen of D_+(a),k ANY integer. CONSTRUCT SAME ACTUAL ell/a^q ring sections and PROVE original homogeneous multiplication equals their multiplication in ORIGINAL integer frames. CONSTRUCT original integer-twist free coordinate maps and PROVE original localized values and original homogeneous map entry values. DERIVE original Koszul entries homogeneous from original H and exterior differential;PROVE EVERY actual original global differential entry is D_ji/a^q. PROVE original coordinate orthogonality and total identity for ALL integer twists. CONSTRUCT genuine bicone,both universal properties,and finite-biproduct iso from SAME original maps;PROVE its actual projections/inclusions are the original ones. CONSTRUCT WHOLE original shifted-free section linear-equivalence from actual coordinate inclusions and integer line frames. PROVE coordinate extraction and reconstruction,retaining arbitrary weights/ALL integer k. PROVE whole frame commutes with EVERY actual original open restriction. ASSEMBLE all entries into equality of WHOLE SAME ORIGINAL GLOBAL Koszul section map with matrix (D_ji/a^q),for ALL degrees p and integer k. No desired coordinate/matrix/frame/transition/compatibility certificate,source regularity/exactness or target FG/FP/free/flat/CM/duality assumption. This is the full original section-map matrix formula and its original restriction compatibility;the identification of D_ji/a^q with standard affine Koszul(H_i/a^q),whole actual affine SHEAF-complex iso,global source exactness/augmentation/finite-cut support/epsilon,derived SHEAF Ext/proper-duality/fixed m remain OPEN. Original4.1/4.2/main OPEN,theta UNVERIFIED,wholecheckpoint180. Private audited continuation until actual frozen publication. Same single guarded compiler8GiB/2threads/CPU25%/20min,oldholds retained,no agents,all task artifacts D.\n\nOPEN: Identify SAME D_ji/a^q with standard affine Koszul(H_i/a^q),all original differentials.\nAssemble SAME actual affine SHEAF-complex iso and original open restrictions.\nDerive global source exactness,original augmentation and finite-cut cohomology support.\nOriginal epsilon/connecting,derived SHEAF Ext,global Cech/proper-duality/uniform fixed m remain OPEN.\nCanonical theta UNVERIFIED;original4.1/4.2/main OPEN;whole checkpoint180.\nThe full section-map matrix formula is checked. Identification of the\nSAME D_p[j,i]/a^q with the standard affine Koszul(H_i/a^q),whole actual\nSHEAF-complex iso,global exactness/augmentation/finite-cut support,\noriginal epsilon/connecting,derived SHEAF Ext,global Cech/proper-duality\nand uniform fixed-m sections remain OPEN. Canonical theta UNVERIFIED;\noriginal4.1/4.2/main OPEN,whole-project checkpoint180. No main-theorem\nstatus is promoted by this separate component.\n\n6 roots,562 physical source lines,23 exact declarations:\n15 proofs,8 definitions;79\nclosed modules,73 older byte-unchanged frozen deps.\nAll exact types,axioms,and ALL8 new definition bodies printed and read.\nOnly propext,Classical.choice,Quot.sound. One compiler,8GiB hard Job,\n2threads,CPU25%,20min;oldholds retained,no extra agents,all task files D.\nLean4.35.0-rc3/mathlib2a885768dae569d938bb9ff3474da6a8753bb90a.\n",
